{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f86b4321-4821-4d1a-8bb0-c11223344556",
    "name": "Praktikum 6 — Endpoint Collection yang Dapat Dicari (Books API)",
    "description": "Postman Collection resmi untuk Praktikum 6 — Endpoint Collection yang Dapat Dicari pada mata kuliah Manajemen Layanan Web.\n\nMenguji:\n1. Paginasi default dan custom per_page / page\n2. Pencarian pada kolom title dan isbn\n3. Pengurutan terarah (asc/desc) dengan allowlist kolom (id, title, isbn, created_at)\n4. Validasi query parameter (422 Unprocessable Content untuk sort dan per_page invalid)\n5. HATEOAS links dan metadata paginasi yang mempertahankan query string",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Week 6 — Paginated Books (Page 1)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has data, links, and meta structure\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('data');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('links');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('meta');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta.current_page).to.eql(1);",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.meta.per_page).to.eql(2);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/books?per_page=2&page=1",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "books"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "per_page",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "key": "page",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
